OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1787957363
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AMatt Lucas and Hugh Bonneville among
OL,4,Aactors calling for law on AI voice
OL,5,Acloning
OL,6,
OL,7,FVoice clones are created by training AI
OL,8,Fon recordings of real people. Quick
OL,9,Fversions can be made in minutes from a
OL,10,Ffew seconds of audio, but high-quality
OL,11,Fcopycats tend to require hours.
OL,13,FAudiobook narrator Alice Sockett, who
OL,14,Fco-founded the campaign, called it "an
OL,15,Fexistential threat to our entire
OL,16,Findustry".
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
