OL,3,APaul Heaton scores first number one
OL,4,Aalbum as Dolly Parton's 9 to 5 finally
OL,5,Areaches top 40
OL,6,
OL,7,FEnglish singer-songwriter Paul Heaton
OL,8,Fhas scored his first solo UK number one
OL,9,Falbum, his sixth overall.
OL,11,FHeaton's latest chart-topping LP -
OL,12,Ftitled Jenius - follows his three with
OL,13,Fthe Beautiful South and two more
OL,14,Falongside former bandmate Jacqui
OL,15,FAbbott.
OL,17,FThe former Housemartins musician
OL,18,Freached the top on Friday, in part, by
OL,19,Fshifting more vinyl copies than any
OL,20,Fother album over the past seven days.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
