OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWhat we know after the big Grand Theft
OL,4,AAuto 6 preview
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter more than 18 months since the
OL,7,Flast official glimpse of Grand Theft
OL,8,FAuto 6, developer Rockstar has shown
OL,9,Ffans a 26-minute preview of the
OL,10,Fupcoming blockbuster video game.
OL,12,FIts "extended look" debuted on Netflix,
OL,13,Fsix hours before going live on YouTube,
OL,14,Fand was the first chance players have
OL,15,Fhad to see detailed footage of the
OL,16,Ftitle in action.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11915
SC,0015
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1787957364
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWhat we know after the big Grand Theft
OL,4,AAuto 6 preview
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe montage, with no commentary or
OL,7,Fexplanatory captions, showed off
OL,8,Fimproved graphics, detailed
OL,9,Fenvironments and a selection of
OL,10,Fcar-chases and shoot-outs from the
OL,11,Fsequel.
OL,13,FThe broadcast followed a week of
OL,14,Funauthorised gameplay leaks, which the
OL,15,Fdeveloper said it had been
OL,16,F"heartbreaking" to see shared online.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
