OL,5,G2330 Everything Is Fake and Nobody
OL,6,G     Cares
OL,7,     FDr Aseem Malhotra reaches millions
OL,8,     Fwith claims about Covid vaccines -
OL,9,     Fand fears the BBC. The question
OL,10,     Fisn't if he's right, but why so
OL,11,     Fmany think he is. Jamie Bartlett
OL,12,     Fmeets him.
